        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 801CE, Chelsea Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple Chelsea handle features oval mounts and classic two piece design. It will look great for traditional homes. Double cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside. This Kwikset 801CE Handleset has solid brass construction and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the inside and outside; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside. In order to increase security, double cylinder handlesets are usually used on front or back doors where there is a window in close proximity to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/chelsea-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800ce\"><b>Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/chelsea-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802ce\"><b>Chelsea Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Two Piece Chelsea Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>10 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 801CE Oval Chelsea Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Bottom Plate: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
